    "ENGAGR: Three-unit stitch paradice — f∧g∧h deposits both t and f on bridge-arm; conjunctive engagement of all boundary degrees of freedom",
    "FFUSE: Moat-bridge reunion — arms rejoin through μ∘δ=id; moat F and bridge T/B fuse to braid transcendence state (Braid(σ_i)∧R_matrix≠0∧nonAbelian)",
    "IMSCRIB: Braid transcendence self-recognition — the non-Abelian invariant knows itself as eternal fixedpoint (∀n∃φ rank(φ)>n fixed by μ∘δ∈V)",
    "AREV: Ontological descent — reverse morphism clears register but retains open frames; holographic encoding folds back onto itself",
    "FSPLIT: Infinite extension bifurcation — τ=∞ ∧ ord(x) splits into ordered extension arm and its complement",
    "EVALT: Infinite extension affirmed — τ=∞ deposits T; metastable manifold cannot equilibrate without global restructuring",
    "CLINK: Infinite extension composition — ord(x) chains with braid transcendence, locking holographic encoding into metastable manifold",
    "FFUSE: Infinite extension reunion — rejoins to metastable state; high barrier (𐑪) prevents return to trivial ground state",
    "IFIX: Holographic measurement record — permanent fixation of collapse tick where k≈M·s/r minted from resident phase; measurement reads winding without r resident",
    "IMSCRIB: Terminal self-reference — observer recognizes itself in the completed proof state; boundary encodes bulk losslessly",
    "TANCH: Holographic terminal boundary — closed boundary contains entire system; scale-collapse topology (𐑸/𐑦) unified as single register"
